# Built from the simulator's consensus Horde route (Tauren export, the Barrens
# visit at 19.6-23.4); not yet play-tested on Forever.
#
# Flow: Orgrimmar -> fly to Ratchet -> the Southsea beach and Northwatch Hold
# (Gilthares' escort back to Ratchet) -> raptor horns on the way to the
# Crossroads (bind) -> Orgrimmar for level 20 training and back -> Barak
# Kodobane -> the Dry Hills (Serena Bloodfeather, Walton and Vrang) -> the
# Sludge Fen shredder and the Boulder Lode Mine -> hearth to the Crossroads ->
# Verog -> Camp Taurajo (flight path) -> the Bristleback camps -> Camp Taurajo
# -> east: the Stolen Silver, Ratchet, Ishamuhale -> the Crossroads -> Regthar,
# Hezrul -> Camp Taurajo (bind): Jorn's thunder lizards and thunderhawks -> the
# south: Field of Giants, Gann Stonespire, Blackthorn Ridge, Bael Modan ->
# hearth to Camp Taurajo -> fly to the Crossroads -> Orgrimmar for
# training and back. The guide ends at the Crossroads; the next one walks north
# to the Mor'shan Rampart and Ashenvale.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - The export binds six times (Crossroads, Camp Taurajo, Ratchet) and hearths
#   three times. Here: bind at the Crossroads, hearth back from the Boulder Lode
#   Mine; bind at Camp Taurajo, hearth back from Bael Modan. Ratchet is
#   visited twice, both on the way.
# - Raptor Horns (865), Miner's Fortune (896) and The Escape (863) are handed
#   in on the second pass through Ratchet; Egg Hunt (868) and Ziz Fizziks
#   (1483) are taken on the first Crossroads and Ratchet stops, so the export's
#   last Crossroads-Ratchet-Crossroads tour is gone.
# - Hezrul Bloodmark (852) is handed in to Regthar on the final Crossroads stop
#   instead of walking back to him at once.
# - Rilli Greasygob (3923) is taken in forever/horde/02-the-barrens, where you
#   stand at Wenikee anyway.
# - Two training trips to Orgrimmar (levels 20 and 23), which the simulator
#   does not model; they also carry the level-20 class quests.
# - Message to Freewind Post (4542) is not taken here: Brave Moonhorn only
#   offers it from level 23 and the route reaches him at about 22.5.
#   forever/horde/07-ashenvale accepts it at the top of the Great Lift on its
#   way to Freewind Post.
# - Field to Clear (98093, Forever) is taken from Sulhasa, up in a tree just
#   east of Gann Stonespire: its lizards and stalkers live on the walk to
#   Blackthorn Ridge.
# - A level-20 stop before the Orgrimmar trip: the class quests there need 20.
# - Walton and Vrang in the order the game offers their quests: Vrang's two
#   first, The Hermit Tanner up to Walton, then Trouble in the Valley and
#   Unwelcome Guests. The export took Walton's two first, which he does not
#   offer yet (a player's report).
# - Visiting order inside a town follows where you arrive: Sputtervalve
#   (beside the wind rider master) first and Dizzywig on the dock last when
#   you fly into Ratchet; Dizzywig first when you walk in from the south
#   coast; Tatternack Steelforge, at the north edge of Camp Taurajo, last;
#   Gann Stonespire's two quests in one visit before Sulhasa.
#
# Group quest: WANTED: Bruuz (92706): Bruuz is elite, so the guide asks
# (`when group 92706`, #639).
# Owatanka (884), Lakota'mani (883), The Harvester (897) and Washte Pawne
# (885) start from the drops of rare spawns: take them if you meet one. The
# Rogue's Mission: Possible But Not Probable (2478): Gallywix is elite.
#
# Dropped:
# - Chen's Empty Keg part 3 (822): its prerequisite (821) is dropped in
#   forever/horde/02-the-barrens, and it would need a final trip to Ratchet.
# - Deepmoss Spider Eggs (1069), Goblin Invaders (1062), Avenge My Village
#   (6548), Letter to Jin'Zil (1060) and ... and that note you found (79007):
#   the route never turns them in. Stepping Stones (79192) follows 79007, so
#   it is not offered either.
#
# Carried on into later guides: Report to Kadrak (6541) and The Ashenvale Hunt
# (6382), Ashenvale; Ziz Fizziks (1483), Stonetalon; Journey to Hillsbrad
# Foothills (493, from Silverpine). Rilli Greasygob (3923) is handed in at 19 in Orgrimmar.
#
# Class quests (training trip at 20): Warrior Speak with Ruga / Trial at the
# Field of Giants / Speak with Thun'grim (1823-1825); the Twitching Antennae
# vanish 15 minutes after they drop (ItemSparse 7119, 900 s), so Warriors
# gather them at the Field of Giants after Gann's last turn-in and hearth to
# Ruga at once, not on the first pass before the hour-long southern loop.
# Brutal Armor (1838 onwards) is in the Warrior class guide Brutal Armor.
# Shaman Call of Water
# (1528, 1530, 1535; 1536 waits at the Spring Well beside Tarren Mill); Warlock
# succubus chain (1507-1513, The Binding on the last Orgrimmar trip). The
# incubus (Love Hurts 65601, Wish You Were Here 65610, The Binding 65604,
# Forever) is left out: Wish You Were Here's scarf drops at about 1 in 20 from
# the bog beasts of Fallen Sky Lake, off the Ashenvale route; see
# forever/class/warlock/incubus-horde. Troll Priest Shadowguard (5680,
# Ur'kyo); Undead Priest Dark Sacrifice (5646, Ur'kyo to Aelthalyste in the
# Undercity, about 25; Forever renamed Devouring Plague); Rogue The Shattered
# Salute / Deep Cover / Mission: Possible But Not Probable (2460, 2458, 2478
# optional) and, if Gallywix falls, Hinott's Assistance (2479, optional:
# Serge Hinott in Tarren Mill teaches Poisons). Tauren Druids open the Sludge
# Fen's Strange Lockbox for Trial of the Sea Lion (30). Druids train in
# Thunder Bluff at 23 and take Cat Form there and in Moonglade (98340, the
# Great Cat Spirit or, for Skyborne, the Windborne one, 98341; 98362);
# Skyborne hand Turak's Moonglade welcome (94913) to Dendrite on the same
# trip, Tauren finish Aquatic Form (30, 31).
# Tauren Druids finish Cure Poison (6127-6130): Dreadmist Peak and Tonga
# Runetotem before the level-20 grind, Kodo Horns and Earthroot on the
# north-west loop, Sickly Gazelles on the way to Verog, Power over Poison on
# the Cat Form trip. Forever rewards Cure Poison only through it.
# Shamans off this route: forever/class/shaman/call-of-water-horde does the
# whole Call of Water chain at 20-23.
#
# Class training: Orgrimmar at 20 and 23 for everyone but Druids and
# Paladins. Druids train in Thunder Bluff at 20 and 23; Paladins in Thunder
# Bluff at 23 (Alodan the Hopeful), after Brill at 19 in the previous guide.
#
# No grind stops: the export has none here.

