  tip South of Gann, the Bael'dun dwarves dig at Bael Modan. Excavators and Foremen work the pit; Prospector Khazgorm (26) carries the journal: pull him alone.
  tip Careful: Excavators (level 21-22) and Foremen (level 22-23) run off for help once they fall to 15% health, so more dwarves can join the fight.
  kill 3374 quest 843.1
