step Blackthorn Ridge
  tip West of Gann, the Razormane hold Blackthorn Ridge. Kuz is on the east side, Nak to the south, Lok Orcbane at the west end. Lok (25) and the Warfrenzies (24-25) are a few levels above you; Hagg Taurenbane, a rare elite, sometimes walks the ridge: leave him. Pathfinders and Stalkers drop the Backstabber, Seers the Wand, Warfrenzies the War Shield. Stormhide lizards and Hecklefang Stalkers roam the plain between Gann and the ridge. Washte Pawne, a rare red wind serpent, flies over the ridge: its feather starts a quest.
  tip Careful: Razormane Stalkers move around in stealth and hit with Sinister Strike, so they can join a fight without warning.
  collect 5073 quest 879.2
