# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The south

step Field of Giants
  tip South of Camp Taurajo the Silithid Mounds dot the Field of Giants; the eggs lie in them, and Silithid Swarmers come out to defend them. Silithid Harvesters are rare: if you see one, kill it for its head.
  tip Careful: Silithid Swarmers in the area release many tiny adds that interrupt spells; damage shields such as Thorns kill them in one hit.
  collect 5058 quest 868.1

step Sulhasa
