step Twitching Antennae
  zone The Barrens
  only Warrior
  tip The antennae vanish fifteen minutes after they drop, so gather them now, on the way back north: kill the Silithid Swarmers and Creepers at the Field of Giants' mounds until you have five, then take them straight to Ruga Ragetotem in Camp Taurajo.
  tip Careful: Silithid Swarmers (level 21-22) cast Silithid Swarm both in and out of combat, which brings several small adds. Silithid Creepers (level 20-21) periodically cast Silithid Creeper Egg in combat, which spawns extra adds.
  collect 7119 quest 1824.1           -- Twitching Antennae from the silithid

